  abilityNotes: "IMPLEMENTED (JusticeAbility). AttackPower stays 0 here ON PURPOSE
    and must not be 'fixed' to 2: the generic resolver only knows lane targeting,
    so a wired stat would add a wrong third attack down its column. Its Attack:2
    lives in JusticeAbility, which strikes the highest-HP and lowest-HP unit each
    Combat phase, and reflects damage dealt to its owner's Soul back onto the attacking
    unit. TARGETING (user decision): ENEMY units only, per the design note's 'threats'
    \u2014 despite the card text's 'on the board'. With one enemy on the board, it
    takes both attacks."
